    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你之前走的时候怎么不想想。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "啊哈哈，我那时候正在气头上嘛！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "确实......我不能放下我的部族不管。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "噢，关于这个，我想你们不用很担心！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
          "text": "虽然不如嘉维尔，不过大丑果然还是很强啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人B",
          "text": "没错没错，我也想造一个玩。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人C",
          "text": "反正神庙也毁了，干脆来比造机器好了，谁造的厉害谁当大酋长怎么样？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人D",
          "text": "喂，还是打架爽啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人C",
          "text": "诶，也对啊，打架也难以放弃，这可怎么办。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人A",
          "text": "哎呀，你们傻啊，一边打架一边比机器不就好了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿达克利斯人们",
          "text": "这个好！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "你看，事实上，你们完全没必要担心。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "根据我的观察，领导者在为未来焦头烂额的时候，其实普通人反而是适应得最快的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "要是我告诉你们，第一任大酋长其实是两百年前一个提亚卡乌勇士自封的，在那之前，根本没有选大酋长的习惯，你们会怎么想？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "......大祭司，你怎么从来没有告诉过我这件事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "噢，我认为这并不重要，不是吗？我只是想告诉你，人们很顽强，他们是不会因为一个传统忽然消失就活不下去的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "倒不如说我一直很奇怪，传统只是将人们聚集到一起的仪式。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "但是当一个传统延续了几十年，你们就会莫名其妙认为它是不可侵犯的，不可打破的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "实际上完全不会有这样的事！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "所以当你说出要轰掉神庙时我是举双手双脚还有尾巴赞成的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "噢，不对，举双手双脚我就不能举尾巴了......嗯？或许我可以趴着？让我来试试！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "......我明白了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "你到底有几岁啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "年龄？忘了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大祭司",
          "text": "而且这是你们用来记录时间的方式，与我无关！虽然我只是已经忘了我是什么时候诞生的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "好吧......不过，不管怎么说，还是得有一个人来做大酋长啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "依娜姆",
          "text": "喂，我听说嘉维尔要和祖玛玛再打一场，打完了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "依娜姆",
          "text": "嘉维尔，你看我干什么？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "依娜姆，你对当大酋长有没有兴趣？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "依娜姆",
          "text": "啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "也就是说，经历了一系列事件后，你们总算是将引擎夺回，并且经过应急处理后，勉强踏上了返程的道路。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "是、是的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "博士，我记得我对你说过，飞行器是非常珍贵的交通工具。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "情况特殊。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不能怪我。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "既然飞行器处于能够维修的范围内，我不会过多责怪你，不过，维修的费用会算在你和煌的工资中。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "诶，我也要吗......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "精英干员应当承担更多的责任。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "呃，好吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "至于你们带回来的三个人，既然你们认为有成为干员的素质，由博士安排就好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "嘉维尔，这次返乡令你感到满意吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "嗯？满意啊，连我也没想到会发生这样的事，很有趣。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "事实上我做过博士没有把你带回来的预案。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "为什么？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "因为我认为你有留在家乡的可能性。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "啊？凯尔希，你这也太见外了吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "但你从未适应过外界的生活，你至今都在以你的方式和这片大地上每天都在发生的事激烈碰撞。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "应该这么说，如果有一天你提出要休息或者离开，我不会意外。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "喂，博士，我不太懂，但是凯尔希这应该是在关心我吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凯尔希",
              "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，你如果没有别的事，可以先离开。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "text": "啧，博士就喜欢这种时候装死。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "text": "那我就当你是在关心我了。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "也许吧。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "text": "不愧是凯尔希，连博士都被绕晕了。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "凯尔希，我不会走的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "我当时决定离开也有一个原因，那就是我确实想当医生。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "当然了，当时的我肯定没想到我真的能成为医生，但我现在庆幸自己当时的决定。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "用现代医学的角度来看，我们那里和没有医生也差不多，得了病就是自生自灭，最多对某些很好治疗的疾病有一些土方。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "如果我没有走出那里的话，我不会知道这片大地是这样子的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "我不会知道原来很多病根本不用死，我不会知道矿石病原来是遭人唾弃的，我不会知道救人和打人一样让我快乐。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "虽然外面确实很复杂，我经常搞不懂一些人的目的，也搞不懂为什么要打起来。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "但我现在是医生，我的理想是治疗矿石病。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "这片大地上还有更适合我学习当医生的地方吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我想恐怕是没有的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "那不就是了。而且你们一个个的天天比我还累，还要来关心我算什么事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "要我说，凯尔希，我来关心你还差不多。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "我不在的时候你没有擅自把我的工作揽过去勉强自己吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "并没有。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "那就好，我要去给祖玛玛检查矿石病了，你们慢慢聊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "啊，那我也去看看克玛尔，哦，现在应该叫燧石了，我去看看她，语言不通，她怕是又要和别人打起来......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "博士，特米米应该在常识课那边，你结束了记得去看一眼。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "嘉维尔。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "欢迎回来。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
          "text": "哈哈。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "咦，我呢？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "你的下一个任务在上个星期就准备好了，理论上来说你已经拖延了很久。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "哦......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "这对你来说应当是一次有些脱离常识的旅行。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "但是，如同嘉维尔的性格一样，这也是这片大地充满生机的证明。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "漫长的时间中，许多事物已经被磨灭了它原有的色彩，过去的理所当然变成了如今的难能可贵。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "text": "我们不得不去寻找人群的细缝间所漏出的光明，并把这种行为视作常态。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
